			"notes": "This is a major update to Blåhaj Mod.\n\n- Added Blåvingad, a stuffed blue whale with a pocket for its mouth!\n  - Based on the real life toy whale from IKEA from the collection with the same name.\n  - You can carry a stack of items inside it.\n  - Right click on an item stack, or right click a stack on it to put the stack in the whale.\n  - Pick up the Blåvingad and right click on an empty slot to remove the item stack.\n- For the time being, you cannot unload directly onto a stack, even if it fits (e.g. Blåvingad with 3 quartz unloading onto a stack of 8 quartz).\n- Added 1.20.1 port (binary compatible with 1.20 and 1.20.2).\n- Added 1.20.4 port (added in commit 51ec630dcf9dd0e05771ffb87010ec9b7ee3514f)"
		},
